{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "喜欢你特别久了  (I Have Liked You for So Long)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Sitting beside Chun Yuqiao as he watches the cat video, Bu Xiaogu realizes he has always been single and impulsively speaks from her heart. Listen to their Mandarin exchange.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我喜欢你，已经喜欢你特别特别久了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你能不能也喜欢我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "先别赶我走，好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但我告诉你，我不是你男朋友不在的时候用来填空的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是这个意思，我完全不是这个意思！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道我现在这个情况，跟你说喜欢你不合适。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我刚才实在是没忍住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要不你能不能就当我没说过这句话？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可是你已经说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说了又能怎么样呢？我现在觉得我天天活着就是个笑话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我每天告诉自己应该感到幸福开心，可是我根本没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我喜欢你，已经喜欢你特别特别久了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I like you—I have liked you for such a very long time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你能不能也喜欢我？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you possibly like me back too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "先别赶我走，好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please do not chase me away just yet, alright?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "但我告诉你，我不是你男朋友不在的时候用来填空的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me make one thing clear: I am not a stand-in to fill the gap when your boyfriend is away.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不是这个意思，我完全不是这个意思！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is not what I meant—that is not what I meant at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道我现在这个情况，跟你说喜欢你不合适。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know that in my current situation, telling you I like you is out of line.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是我刚才实在是没忍住。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet just now I truly could not hold it back anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "要不你能不能就当我没说过这句话？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could you perhaps pretend I never said those words?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "可是你已经说了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Except you already said them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说了又能怎么样呢？我现在觉得我天天活着就是个笑话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So what if I said them? Right now I feel like my everyday life is a joke.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我每天告诉自己应该感到幸福开心，可是我根本没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Every day I tell myself I ought to feel happy, yet there is nothing I can do.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我喜欢你，已经喜欢你特别特别久了。",
      "gap": 0.5
