    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "说了又能怎么样呢？我现在觉得我天天活着就是个笑话。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我每天告诉自己应该感到幸福开心，可是我根本没有办法。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Hurt that Chun Yuqiao thinks she is merely looking for a stand-in while her boyfriend is away, Bu Xiaogu admits how helpless she feels over her own feelings. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
